			"notes": "## v1.2.1 — Custom Pet Icons\n\n### What's new\n- **Custom pet icons** — Black Cat, Golden Dragon, and Phoenix now show your custom textures instead of vanilla item icons\n- **Cleaner pet names** — `[Lvl 100]` brackets and `⭐` stars are stripped; only the real pet name is shown\n- **No tooltips in Favorites mode** — hovering a pet in Only Favorites mode no longer shows the lore tooltip\n\n### Fixes\n- Fixed `ResourceLocation` → `Identifier` API for Minecraft 1.21.11\n- Fixed texture loading: PNGs are now registered via `DynamicTexture` + `TextureManager` before rendering"
		},
