			"notes": "## What's new\n\n- **Auto Profile** — AutoLeap now automatically switches to the matching profile (Tank / Mage / Archer / Healer / Berserker) when you enter a dungeon, based on your detected class. Can be disabled in the module settings.\n\n## Installation\n\nDrop the jar into your `mods/` folder alongside [Odin](https://github.com/odtheking/Odin)."
		},
