			"notes": "## Auto Leap\n\n### Class Profiles\n- Added **Profile** selector in the module GUI (Tank / Mage / Archer / Healer / Berserker)\n- Each profile stores independent leap targets for every section, saved to `config/trji/autoleap_profiles.json`\n- Switch profiles instantly from the GUI — your configured targets update automatically\n- `/trji profile` — print every section and configured class for the active profile\n- `/trji profile set <section> <class>` — configure a section (e.g. `/trji profile set EE1 Healer`)\n- Sections: `Clear`, `EE1`, `EE2`, `EE2Fallback`, `EE3`, `EE3Fallback`, `EE4`, `Core`, `3x3`, `Mid`, `P5`, `P2`, `PY`\n\n### Boss Death Leap Triggers\n- Leap triggers for **P2, EE1, 3x3, and P5** now fire on actual boss death (boss bar HP → 0) instead of dialogue lines\n- More reliable and faster — fires the instant the boss dies, not when they speak\n- **PY** remains chat-based since Storm does not die at PY\n- Added toggle for each trigger: `P2 Auto Leap`, `P5 Auto Leap`, `PY Auto Leap`, `3x3 Auto Leap`\n\n### EE2 / EE3 Fallback\n- Configurable fallback class for EE2 and EE3 — if the primary target is dead, leaps to the fallback instead\n- Set via `/trji profile set EE2Fallback <class>` and `/trji profile set EE3Fallback <class>`\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- Fixed Storm double-leap: `pyAutoLeaped` flag now resets only on world load instead of when leaving the PY section coordinate zone, preventing Storm's dialogue firing again at EE1 from re-triggering the PY leap\n\n---\n\n## Big Timer\n\n### Personal Best Tracking\n- Tracks room completion times with personal bests (solo and team separately)\n- `/trji bt pbs` — list all PBs\n- `/trji bt pb <room>` — list PBs for a specific room\n- `/trji bt resetpbs` — clear all PBs\n- `/trji bt resetpb <room>` — clear PBs for a specific room\n- `/trji bt <room> <count>` — override secret count for a room\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- Fixed rooms showing 0.0s: now tracks secret count delta from room entry instead of cumulative total, so secrets from previous rooms don't instantly complete the next room\n- Fixed random room completions: rooms already finished this run are tracked in a set and cannot be re-timed; same-room re-entry events are ignored; completion requires at least 1 second in the room"
		},
